。\n- ピンクの髪の子はエルフ族の魔法使いで、黒い髪の子はドラゴン族の剣士です。\n- ピンク髪の武器は弓で、黒い髪の武器は大剣です。色や具体的なデザインはすべてお任せします！ご自由に創作してください。\n\n【OC設定】 https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1W3ntXmnQbOSwJva803Ou4ZGpQexlQESq  \n\n金額が不足する場合は再送してください。 \nよろしくお願いします。", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@moru147650/works/13", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3749739, "client_id": 2576457, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7fef7719/uploads/origins/137a8b33-0ca3-487a-baee-e09b9def5761?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a767fe9b61dbec5c7d51edfea62285d5", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7fef7719/uploads/origins/137a8b33-0ca3-487a-baee-e09b9def5761?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a767fe9b61dbec5c7d51edfea62285d5, https://si.imgix.net/7fef7719/uploads/origins/137a8b33-0ca3-487a-baee-e09b9def5761?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=de44c3bb091beda66a47ad0963d7884b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7fef7719/uploads/origins/137a8b33-0ca3-487a-baee-e09b9def5761?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3f99afde47554dcfe17d38ed0b07ad02 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7fef7719/uploads/origins/137a8b33-0ca3-487a-baee-e09b9def5761?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=637f81b9aa92eab648641211d1106e3b", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7fef7719/uploads/origins/137a8b33-0ca3-487a-baee-e09b9def5761?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=637f81b9aa92eab648641211d1106e3b, https://si.imgix.net/7fef7719/uploads/origins/137a8b33-0ca3-487a-baee-e09b9def5761?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s